# `@x` assigned to a reference as the FIRST use of a free name (the author 2026-11-18, answer Q3; the path of lmx_graph_eval_value, the branch `@name`): the binding
# is chosen at that moment and the address is that of the place of the activation -- the local copy. After the local write `x := 7`, `\p` reads 7,
# while the root's x stays 10 (rx).
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: r 0
        int: rx 0
)
@: shared data[0]
int: x 10
fn: w () int
    @: p int
    p := @x
    x := 7
    return: \p
int: r w()
int: rx x

sub: main ()
    shared\Observed\r := r
    shared\Observed\rx := rx
main()
